a&_nc_ohc=YU1sRNKADTAQ7kNvwGCIg4t&_nc_oc=AdorTBBXcrYcAfayJ49DtREk21UGTL_h6nXTfB8zqqBZq4QXfbH_SRta7VixTgatheQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQIrAjtAu-dVi1yH0EPIyDSYJ-VXL838yo-H6aSux0NCA&oe=6B085F24"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-1-alignment.png", "id": "1005930632535169", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830904_1005930639201835_6987101909884018828_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KAKPQioNcZQQ7kNvwFUuF7P&_nc_oc=AdqRfCvwe-L9o-3zjcsTBVJWBi8Hnwoo7_T4JTkBttkcueGKhKDw9lRcIZGJtjQmRnA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSVIEPF6p31ohyPI3pZrIP0enndxhBrT8-OJMrOmXeO0Q&oe=6B0872C6"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-4-moons.png", "id": "1648043520236033", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831393_1648043523569366_1043769257316157600_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p3PKGk6wbcUQ7kNvwEQWjnT&_nc_oc=AdqkLKNJs9cDBqbBeocYVzhfqA-RPOg9_2_8jSEII0wwfQ0nThQo2MXr7S2KMWgLkSg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSwE50pgEMo91KDFjoScI2FQcxoiv0HDRbFbV-xZYiaZA&oe=6B085B92"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-5-spiral.png", "id": "1100777082812173", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830904_1100777086145506_6071435689086224047_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-lhabrxNL94Q7kNvwGM1S3V&_nc_oc=AdryYaFTr2ywDUSADAULijaGdUovjSFrIrVgOrUNiq4ojwqPB93p715s3U63_Zo-8IY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQsIPqSLw7wa5nWET6JazdBGM6hTpw0uzkGkpg2-FySzg&oe=6B086A97"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "universal-basic.png", "id": "1152553820442784", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673759338_1152553823776117_6844216478563381854_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VI2aI24qHN4Q7kNvwHIWZnj&_nc_oc=AdpJEbDXU2E7E_YOvbOx4_BlIN3fsMXV2CGuSO7GPeu5UWnzCTF5FM2_XEYAdBen1W4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRmQ8_iDKiPTTe6DrmfR00h9Ev31egydLWqMRO62tEPsA&oe=6B08411C"}, "display_name": "Orrery", "keywords": ["Puzzle", "Space"], "long_description": "A solar system turns below you, drawn in pure white vector light. In your hand: a comet.\n\nThrow it, and the star pulls it in. Every planet tugs at it as it passes. Swing past a world and slingshot onward; thread a line through\nthree beacons with a single throw. Each of Orrery's 99 levels is a small puzzle of real gravity, and every one is proven solvable in\npar.\n\n  - 99 levels in nine chapters, each bringing a new idea: aligned beacons, swaying beacons, crowded moons, linked pairs, golden beacons\nthat only count after a chain, numbered sequences and more.\n- Real orbital physics: the star and every planet and moon pull on every comet, and planets move at their true orbital speeds.\n- Combos on the Fibonacci sequence. Chain slingshots and strikes in one flight and keep a streak going across throws to multiply your\nscore and earn comets back.\n- Rate yourself against par on every level, and chase three golden spirals on all 99.\n- Every size and distance in the game is built on the golden ratio, from the spacing of the orbits to the letters on the screen.\n- A sparse twelve-tone heartbeat score that\nquickens the longer you think.\n\nYou stand still and the system stays where it is, so it's comfortable to play seated or standing.", "short_description": " Throw comets through a living solar system. Bend them around planets, chain slingshots and strike every golden spiral in 99 hand-built puzzles of gravity."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://atonalfugue-ecfggyfue0efbwhm.westus-01.azurewebsites.net/orrery/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Atonal Fugue", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://atonalfugue-ecfggyfue0efbwhm